WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:04.630
MAN: Wounded coming in.

00:00:04.630 --> 00:00:05.800
MAN: All right, here we go.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:06.600
All right.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.005
[INAUDIBLE] I
can't rouse myself.

00:00:08.005 --> 00:00:08.880
MAN: Take it through.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.005
MAN: We don't got nowhere--

00:00:12.594 --> 00:00:14.770
[CHATTER]

00:00:16.225 --> 00:00:17.060
All right, Julian.

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.368
You can chain
him on the floor.

00:00:20.368 --> 00:00:25.328
[CHATTER]

00:00:32.768 --> 00:00:36.240
[SOBBING]

00:00:44.672 --> 00:00:48.144
[LOCK CLICKS]

00:00:56.576 --> 00:01:00.048
[CHAINS CLANK]

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:09.472
[GRUNTING]

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:17.860
What do they call you?

00:01:20.035 --> 00:01:20.835
Thomas.

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:27.730
Do you have a family, Thomas?

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:37.175
A wife, someone to think about?

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:41.280
Mama?

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:56.200
Then remember, this is just
work, same as you always done,

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:57.160
just work.

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:02.180
God is with us.

00:02:06.770 --> 00:02:11.060
How can you say that to him?

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:12.770
God is with us?

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:19.000
Where is he?

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:24.760
Like, why has he
not set you free?

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:28.930
Or has he?

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:35.635
You are not in these.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:41.680
Well, then, stand up.

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:43.120
Stand up.
Go.

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:44.050
Stand up.

00:02:44.050 --> 00:02:47.410
Stand up, and then praise
your God for all he has

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:50.650
done for you, for all of us.

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:06.350
You-- God is not with you.

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:07.150
He is nowhere.

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:16.060
He sends that fool to
tell us about his word,

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:21.805
to be a good slave, to be
obedient to your masters.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:29.870
Is that what God says to you?

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:36.520
God says many things.

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:39.740
I do not know why.

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:46.175
God shows himself to some
people and not to others.

00:03:50.010 --> 00:04:02.680
But if you do not know
him, I will pray for you.

